{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af149a6","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"9sIP-jpNjtA1JPCBjTf-H","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# VLOOKUP / HLOOKUP\n\n`VLOOKUP` searches for a value in the first column of a table and returns a value from a specified column in the same row. `HLOOKUP` does the same horizontally, searching across the first row. Both are used to merge data from different tables, though they have been largely replaced by `XLOOKUP` in modern Excel.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"VLOOKUP Function","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/office/vlookup-function-0bbc8083-26fe-4963-8ab8-93a18ad188a1","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a19"},{"type":"article","title":"HLOOKUP Function","url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/office/hlookup-function-a3034eec-b719-4ba3-bb65-e1ad662ed95f","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a1a"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/9sIP-jpNjtA1JPCBjTf-H.md"}